  surface to use them from — confirmed live by the reviewer, who could not manage this
  table through the Grant Administration app despite holding the privilege. That is the
  IMP-0090 pattern (privilege granted, navigation surface never added) recurring on this
  table specifically, and this file is the fix's third of four required changes (entity,
  SubArea, AppModuleComponent, form/view — see AppModuleSiteMap.xml and AppModule.xml in
  this same change for the other three).

  SHAPE COPIED FROM Entities/rev_setting/FormXml/main/{60e05819-...}.xml (one tab, one
  section, one column, one row per field, celllabelposition="Left", labelwidth="180") —
  the simplest existing form in this solution and the one this table's own Entity.xml
  comment already names as its schema-authoring precedent.

