  below, {C3EBB6DA-CE32-4df0-8534-30B624E393CF}, is Dataverse's documented classic
  "Decimal Number" field control id and is used on the five Decimal attributes on this form
  (rev_amountcommitted, rev_grantgivingcapacity, rev_suggestedmaximumspend,
  rev_monthlydisbursement, rev_remaininglegacyfund) — but per this project's own recorded
  history (`platform-contract-guessed-not-groundtruthed`, logs/known-failure-modes.md, 42
  prior instances) a documented-but-unverified-on-THIS-instance shape is exactly the class
  of guess that must be declared rather than asserted. Ground-truthing it the way
  AppModuleSiteMap.xml and AppModule.xml were ground-truthed (build the real component in
  DEV, export, unpack) needs a human in the maker portal's form designer — an agent session
